Stdout:
ST202  API rejected schema-compliant request
checks positive_data_acceptance

Schema-valid request rejected.

A `Hint:` line names undeclared properties the body carried. A rejection the
schema can't express, such as an unknown id or a cross-field rule, can be
allowed for the operation:

  # schemathesis.toml
  [[operations]]
  include-name = "POST /orders"
  checks.positive_data_acceptance.expected-statuses = [
    "2xx", "3xx", "401", "403", "404", "409", "429", "5xx", "422",
  ]

`--exclude-checks positive_data_acceptance` turns it off, along with ST206.
